      ],
      "description": "创建安全组规则请求详情。",
      "properties": {
        "ip_protocol": {
          "description": "协议类型,取值范围:\n* icmp\n* tcp\n* udp \n* any,表示支持所有协议。\n\n协议类型为icmp时,起始端口值和结束端口值取值范围如下(格式:icmp协议类型名称(from_port, to_port)):\n* Any(-1, -1)\n* Echo(8, 0)\n* Echo reply(0, 0)\n* Fragment need DF set(3, 4)\n* Host redirect(5, 1)\n* Host TOS redirect(5, 3)\n* Host unreachable(3, 1)\n* Information reply(16, 0)\n* Information request(15, 0)\n* Net redirect(5, 0)\n* Net TOS redirect(5, 2)\n* Net unreachable(3, 0)\n* Parameter problem(12, 0)\n* Port unreachable(3, 3)\n* Protocol unreachable(3, 2)\n* Reassembly timeout(11, 1)\n* Source quench(4, 0)\n* Source route failed(3, 5)\n* Timestamp reply(14, 0)\n* Timestamp request(13, 0)\n* TTL exceeded(11, 0)",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "ip_ranges": {
          "description": "远端IP地址,和remote_group_id互斥,取值范围:子网格式,或者IP段格式。\n* IPv4示例:子网格式:192.168.5.0/255.255.255.0;IP段格式:192.168.5.0-192.168.5.255",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "allowed_sg_id": {
          "description": "对端安全组ID和ip_ranges互斥。(预留)",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "from_port": {
          "description": "起始端口值\n* 取值范围:0~65535\n* 协议类型为icmp时:必须为protocol字段说明中定义的特定端口值\n* 协议类型为tcp或udp时:取值不能大于to_port的值\n* 协议类型为any时:取值必须为-1",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "to_port": {
          "description": "结束端口值\n* 取值范围:0~65535\n* 协议类型为icmp时:必须为protocol字段说明中定义的特定端口值\n* 协议类型为tcp或udp时:取值不能小于from_port的值\n* 协议类型为any时:取值必须为-1",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "direction": {
          "description": "出入控制方向,当前仅支持入方向。取值范围:\n* 1:出方向(预留)\n* 0:入方向",
